=== 2 information_schema 显示长度/精度 ===
id|integer|||32|2|0
v5|varchar_enc|5|20|||
v100|varchar_enc|100|400|||
b3|bpchar_enc|3|12|||
n52|numeric_enc|||5|10|2
t|text_enc|||||
